# Runtime data. Never commit this.
#   data/.session-secret          the HMAC key that signs session + CSRF tokens
#   data/campusflow.json          the database, including user_credentials (password hashes)
#   data/campusflow-traffic.json  the traffic / peak demand model
#
# The schema is code (server/db.ts) and the seed is code, so the store rebuilds
# itself on first run. Losing this directory is recoverable; leaking it is not.
data/
*.session-secret
